{"seq":25,"trial_id":"v04-cal-r1-2026-11/openclaw-opus-gbrain-told-live-rr-l2-mu-v04-dev/rr-08-l2-tansley-parcel-site-retired/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-06T16:10:18.824Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-17T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"bebc2e88ab4f08d51b2a7502854a2584a996d3b44932c054593fe81b05c7879b","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV04CAL0001","text":"Hi Tobias, here are both for the Tansley Parcel file:\n\n1. Depot site: Southgate. In #inc-tansley-carrier-api on 2025-09-03, Pree said label printing had stalled at Tansley Parcel depots and Southgate dispatch had totes stacked beside door 4. When she closed the incident at 18:43, she said Southgate had cleared the backlog.\n\n2. Yard jockey login problem at the Tulsa hub: Lev Arkadin is the contact. Pree said in #central-team on 2025-07-02 that he'd messaged her about it. One caveat: he's the person who raised the issue, and I couldn't find anything that names him as the account's main contact. Pree owns Tansley Parcel, so she can confirm."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV04CAL0001","ts":"1792245600.000126"}}
